{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012","id":3462513865,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6q-FqL","number":111012,"title":"Delete \"Activate now?\" button","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-09-28T20:56:37Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:42Z","closed_at":"2025-10-09T16:52:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-09T16:52:59Z"},"body":"Give one reason why it should stay.\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|-|-|\r\n|<img width=\"523\" height=\"584\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86378986-d21c-41fa-bdc5-e1cc38d2a6a1\" />|<img width=\"521\" height=\"552\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/253467db-d8b4-4e66-9beb-e737c1e64e95\" />|\r\n\r\nTypical plugin creation workflow: you open the Plugins tab, select Create New Plugin, type name and optionally other stuff, confirm. The addon is created, you edit the script and do something like\r\n```GDScript\r\nextends EditorPlugin\r\nvar dock: Control\r\nfunc _enter_tree():\r\n\tdock = load(\"dock_scene.tscn\")\r\n\tadd_dock(dock)\r\n\r\nfunc _exit_tree():\r\n\tremove_dock(dock)\r\n```\r\nThen go to Plugins tab again, disable your newly created addon and then enable again so the dock is added.\r\nBut now you have an error in your Output: `Error: p_dock is null, in remove_dock()`. That's because your plugin was activated while it had no code and tried to deinitialize when you disabled it. However `dock` only exists when you enable the plugin _and_ it actually creates the dock.\r\n\r\nThere is zero reason to activate the plugin immediately. `add_control_to_dock()`, `add_export_plugin()`, `add_context_menu_plugin()` etc. all typically run in `_enter_tree()`, but when your script is just created, this code does not exist yet, so to register your new docks/plugins you have to run `_enter_tree()` again, which means disabling and enabling the script. If you have to disable it to do anything then why even enable it beforehand? It would be maybe fine if it was harmless, but if you deactivate a plugin that wasn't initialized, you end up with useless errors.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012/reactions","total_count":17,"+1":17,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}